      <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none" data-aos="fade-up">
        <p class="font-inter text-secondary leading-loose text-lg mb-6">Massage guns have become an essential tool for athletes, fitness enthusiasts, and anyone dealing with muscle tension. These percussive therapy devices use rapid bursts of pressure to increase blood flow, reduce soreness, and accelerate recovery. This article features the 10 best massage guns of 2026, from professional-grade devices to affordable options for beginners.</p>
        <h2 class="font-playfair text-2xl font-bold text-dark-bg mt-12 mb-6 flex items-center gap-3"><span class="w-8 h-px bg-gold-primary"></span>Product Comparison Table</h2>
