          <th class="px-4 py-3 text-left font-semibold text-dark-bg">Rating</th>
          <th class="px-4 py-3 text-left font-semibold text-dark-bg">Key Features</th>
        </tr></thead><tbody class="divide-y divide-border">
<tr class="hover:bg-cream transition-colors"><td class="px-4 py-4"><span class="font-bold text-gold-primary">#1</span></td><td class="px-4 py-4 font-semibold">Theragun Pro</td><td class="px-4 py-4">$399.00</td><td class="px-4 py-4">Professional grade</td><td class="px-4 py-4"><span class="text-gold-primary">★★★★★</span></td><td class="px-4 py-4 text-secondary">QuietForce technology, 5 attachments</td></tr>
<tr class="hover:bg-cream transition-colors"><td class="px-4 py-4"><span class="font-bold text-gold-primary">#2</span></td><td class="px-4 py-4 font-semibold">Hyperice Hypervolt 2 Pro</td><td class="px-4 py-4">$299.00</td><td class="px-4 py-4">5 speeds, App control</td><td class="px-4 py-4"><span class="text-gold-primary">★★★★★</span></td><td class="px-4 py-4 text-secondary">Bluetooth App integration</td></tr>
<tr class="hover:bg-cream transition-colors"><td class="px-4 py-4"><span class="font-bold text-gold-primary">#3</span></td><td class="px-4 py-4 font-semibold">BOULDER Massager Gun</td><td class="px-4 py-4">$129.99</td><td class="px-4 py-4">7 speeds, 10mm amplitude</td><td class="px-4 py-4"><span class="text-gold-primary">★★★★☆</span></td><td class="px-4 py-4 text-secondary">Budget premium option</td></tr>
<tr class="hover:bg-cream transition-colors"><td class="px-4 py-4"><span class="font-bold text-gold-primary">#4</span></td><td class="px-4 py-4 font-semibold">Renpho Massage Gun</td><td class="px-4 py-4">$89.99</td><td class="px-4 py-4">6 speeds, beginner grade</td><td class="px-4 py-4"><span class="text-gold-primary">★★★★☆</span></td><td class="px-4 py-4 text-secondary">Entry-level champion</td></tr>
<tr class="hover:bg-cream transition-colors"><td class="px-4 py-4"><span class="font-bold text-gold-primary">#5</span></td><td class="px-4 py-4 font-semibold">Timmi Massager Gun Mini</td><td class="px-4 py-4">$59.99</td><td class="px-4 py-4">Mini portable model</td><td class="px-4 py-4"><span class="text-gold-primary">★★★★☆</span></td><td class="px-4 py-4 text-secondary">Ultra-portable</td></tr>
        </tbody></table></div>
        <h2 class="font-playfair text-2xl font-bold text-dark-bg mt-12 mb-6 flex items-center gap-3"><span class="w-8 h-px bg-gold-primary"></span>Detailed Reviews</h2>
        <div class="space-y-12"><div class="bg-cream rounded-2xl p-8"><div class="flex items-start gap-4 mb-4"><span class="font-playfair text-4xl font-bold text-gold-primary">1</span><div class="flex-1"><h3 class="font-playfair text-xl font-bold text-dark-bg mb-2">Theragun Pro</h3><div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3"><span class="text-gold-primary">★★★★★</span><span class="font-inter text-sm text-muted">|</span><span class="font-inter text-sm text-gold-primary font-semibold">$399.00</span></div></div></div><p class="font-inter text-secondary leading-relaxed mb-4">The Theragun Pro is the undisputed king of massage guns. Its QuietForce technology delivers powerful percussive therapy at just 40 decibels — quieter than a normal conversation. The 7-hour battery life means you can use it all week without charging, and the 5 speed settings provide precise control for any muscle group.</p><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-3 mb-4"><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#2D5A4C" stroke-width="2"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"/></svg><span class="font-inter text-sm text-secondary">Quietest in class at 40dB</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#2D5A4C" stroke-width="2"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"/></svg><span class="font-inter text-sm text-secondary">5 speed settings (1750-2400 PPM)</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#2D5A4C" stroke-width="2"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"/></svg><span class="font-inter text-sm text-secondary">Long 7-hour battery</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#2D5A4C" stroke-width="2"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"/></svg><span class="font-inter text-sm text-secondary">Professional-grade depth</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#6B6B6B" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><line x1="15" y1="9" x2="9" y2="15"/><line x1="9" y1="9" x2="15" y2="15"/></svg><span class="font-inter text-sm text-secondary">Premium price</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#6B6B6B" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><line x1="15" y1="9" x2="9" y2="15"/><line x1="9" y1="9" x2="15" y2="15"/></svg><span class="font-inter text-sm text-secondary">Heavy at 2.75 lbs</span></div></div><a href="#" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 btn-gold text-sm">Check Price on Amazon &rarr;</a></div><div class="bg-cream rounded-2xl p-8"><div class="flex items-start gap-4 mb-4"><span class="font-playfair text-4xl font-bold text-gold-primary">2</span><div class="flex-1"><h3 class="font-playfair text-xl font-bold text-dark-bg mb-2">Hyperice Hypervolt 2 Pro</h3><div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3"><span class="text-gold-primary">★★★★★</span><span class="font-inter text-sm text-muted">|</span><span class="font-inter text-sm text-gold-primary font-semibold">$299.00</span></div></div></div><p class="font-inter text-secondary leading-relaxed mb-4">The Hyperice Hypervolt 2 Pro brings smart features to percussive therapy. Its Bluetooth-connected app lets you customize treatment programs, track your sessions, and choose from pre-set routines designed by physical therapists. The pilot light feature is genius — it glows green when you are applying the right amount of pressure.</p><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-3 mb-4"><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#2D5A4C" stroke-width="2"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"/></svg><span class="font-inter text-sm text-secondary">Pilot light indicates pressure</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#2D5A4C" stroke-width="2"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"/></svg><span class="font-inter text-sm text-secondary">App-controlled modes</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#2D5A4C" stroke-width="2"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"/></svg><span class="font-inter text-sm text-secondary">Quiet operation</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#2D5A4C" stroke-width="2"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"/></svg><span class="font-inter text-sm text-secondary">Ergonomic handle</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#6B6B6B" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><line x1="15" y1="9" x2="9" y2="15"/><line x1="9" y1="9" x2="15" y2="15"/></svg><span class="font-inter text-sm text-secondary">App required for full features</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#6B6B6B" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><line x1="15" y1="9" x2="9" y2="15"/><line x1="9" y1="9" x2="15" y2="15"/></svg><span class="font-inter text-sm text-secondary">Mid-range price</span></div></div><a href="#" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 btn-gold text-sm">Check Price on Amazon &rarr;</a></div><div class="bg-cream rounded-2xl p-8"><div class="flex items-start gap-4 mb-4"><span class="font-playfair text-4xl font-bold text-gold-primary">3</span><div class="flex-1"><h3 class="font-playfair text-xl font-bold text-dark-bg mb-2">BOULDER Massager Gun</h3><div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3"><span class="text-gold-primary">★★★★☆</span><span class="font-inter text-sm text-muted">|</span><span class="font-inter text-sm text-gold-primary font-semibold">$129.99</span></div></div></div><p class="font-inter text-secondary leading-relaxed mb-4">The BOULDER Massager Gun offers remarkable value at $129.99. With 7 speed levels, a 10mm therapeutic amplitude, and 8 included massage heads, it competes with devices costing twice as much. While it is louder at maximum speed, the performance-to-price ratio makes it our top pick for budget-conscious buyers.</p><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-3 mb-4"><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#2D5A4C" stroke-width="2"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"/></svg><span class="font-inter text-sm text-secondary">7 speed levels</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#2D5A4C" stroke-width="2"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"/></svg><span class="font-inter text-sm text-secondary">10mm therapeutic depth</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#2D5A4C" stroke-width="2"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"/></svg><span class="font-inter text-sm text-secondary">8 massage heads included</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#2D5A4C" stroke-width="2"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"/></svg><span class="font-inter text-sm text-secondary">Great value at $129.99</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#6B6B6B" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><line x1="15" y1="9" x2="9" y2="15"/><line x1="9" y1="9" x2="15" y2="15"/></svg><span class="font-inter text-sm text-secondary">Loud at highest speed</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#6B6B6B" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><line x1="15" y1="9" x2="9" y2="15"/><line x1="9" y1="9" x2="15" y2="15"/></svg><span class="font-inter text-sm text-secondary">Shorter battery life</span></div></div><a href="#" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 btn-gold text-sm">Check Price on Amazon &rarr;</a></div></div>
        <h2 class="font-playfair text-2xl font-bold text-dark-bg mt-12 mb-6 flex items-center gap-3"><span class="w-8 h-px bg-gold-primary"></span>How We Chose</h2>
        <p class="font-inter text-secondary leading-loose mb-6">We tested 12 massage guns over six weeks, evaluating amplitude, noise levels, battery life, ergonomic design, and effectiveness on different muscle groups. We consulted with physical therapists and compared results against clinical studies on percussion therapy.</p>
        <h2 class="font-playfair text-2xl font-bold text-dark-bg mt-12 mb-6 flex items-center gap-3"><span class="w-8 h-px bg-gold-primary"></span>FAQ</h2>
        <div class="space-y-6"><div class="bg-cream rounded-xl p-6"><h3 class="font-playfair font-semibold text-lg text-dark-bg mb-2">Q: How often should I use a massage gun?</h3><p class="font-inter text-secondary">Most experts recommend using a massage gun 2-3 times per week on the same muscle group. Each session should last no more than 2 minutes per area. Daily use is safe for most people, but allow 48 hours between sessions on the same muscle for optimal recovery.</p></div><div class="bg-cream rounded-xl p-6"><h3 class="font-playfair font-semibold text-lg text-dark-bg mb-2">Q: Can massage guns help with chronic pain?</h3><p class="font-inter text-secondary">Massage guns can provide significant relief for muscle-related chronic pain. The American College of Sports Medicine recognizes percussive therapy as effective for reducing muscle stiffness and improving range of motion. However, always consult a healthcare provider for persistent pain conditions.</p></div><div class="bg-cream rounded-xl p-6"><h3 class="font-playfair font-semibold text-lg text-dark-bg mb-2">Q: What is the difference between amplitude and speed?</h3><p class="font-inter text-secondary">Amplitude refers to how far the massage head travels with each pulse (measured in millimeters). Higher amplitude means deeper tissue penetration. Speed refers to how many pulses per minute (PPM). Both matter: amplitude determines depth, while speed determines intensity.</p></div></div>
        <div class="mt-12 p-8 bg-gradient-to-r from-gold-primary/10 to-gold-light/10 rounded-2xl border-l-4 border-gold-primary"><h2 class="font-playfair text-2xl font-bold text-dark-bg mb-4">Final Verdict</h2><p class="font-inter text-secondary leading-relaxed mb-4">For professional-grade performance, the <strong>Theragun Pro</strong> at $399 is worth every penny. For best value, the <strong>BOULDER Massager Gun</strong> at $129.99 delivers 70% of the performance at one-third the price. For beginners, the <strong>Renpho Massage Gun</strong> at $89.99 is an excellent entry point.</p><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 mt-6"><a href="#" class="btn-gold text-sm">Check Price on Amazon</a><a href="/blog" class="btn-gold-outline text-sm">More Reviews</a></div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
